  "$comment": "Mirrors stage2/document-form.md. validate_forms.py additionally checks word counts, calendar dates, required details, part references, return line consistency and native-text evidence at the cited location; scans require visual review. not_found is allowed for unanswered questions. Empty auxiliary detail strings remain allowed where no detail is called for.",
